{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blast rocks. Dodge chaos. Unlock ships.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocks In Space is a fast-paced retro arcade shooter built to deliver pure fun \u2014 no ads, no paywalls, no grind walls. Just you, your ship, and endless waves of destruction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic arcade action</strong> \u2013 Tight controls and fast reflex gameplay inspired by golden-era shooters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless survival mode</strong> \u2013 Face wave after wave of asteroids and enemy craft.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable ships</strong> \u2013 Earn new ships with unique playstyles and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades &amp; progression</strong> \u2013 Power up your weapons and see how long you can last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Compete with friends and players worldwide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No nonsense</strong> \u2013 No  pay-to-win, no microtransactions, unlock by PLAYING!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Rocks In Space?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s simple: fun first. Whether you\u2019re chasing high scores, unlocking every ship, or just blasting rocks after a long day, Rocks In Space brings back the thrill of old-school arcade shooters \u2014 with a modern indie twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now and be ready to take off.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blast through relentless waves. Upgrade your ship. Survive the swarm.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocks In Space is a retro-styled arcade shooter built with one rule: <i>fun over fluff</i>. No ads. No microtransactions. Just pure shoot-\u2019em-up action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037590/extras/c3b0c6235dd687ba1017088920962d7e.avif?t=1766321852\" width=1024 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 unique ship types</strong> \u2014 each with its own playstyle </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic upgrades &amp; powerups</strong> \u2014 customize your loadout mid-run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam integration</strong> \u2014 41 achievements, leaderboards, and full offline support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay value for days</strong> \u2014 randomized runs mean every session is fresh</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pepare to defend the galaxy. Your ship awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":" Always Remember Your First","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4037590/25d1e5d53fa8ac75103ea29a177c6f3b8f3d9c8c.jpg"},{"name":"Ships Incoming !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4037590/cab8d0a1511a3c7ff11da206eba2c99c1d06c124.jpg"},{"name":"That's A Big Ship!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4037590/710e8445a829a28727afce44d432cb7a6f6be71d.jpg"},{"name":"Almost The End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4037590/c596fb01293660c53b8ebcfd48599ca7d29204d2.jpg"},{"name":"The Final Battle .... Never Ends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4037590/2cced73dbe9ef814acc32c14aeb90d4a7c7d7c1a.jpg"},{"name":"The Rapid Fire Ship","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4037590/b4ec3038231accad9db1cc6d3a86f2dd30bab9ea.jpg"},{"name":"The